        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. The incumbents in each job description effective November 17, 2001 will be upgraded to the respective labor grade for their successor job description. Those incumbents in the MS \"A\" will be credited with 1 Core and 2 Non core skills; MS \"B\" will be credited with 2 Non core skills and those in MS \"C\" will be credited with 1 Non core skill. Incumbent employees classified as Air Conditioning and Refrigeration Mechanic L/G 23 will receive a $500 award for each core skill obtained, not to exceed 2 core skills.",
            "block_bbox": [
                85,
                724,
