        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. \"Core\" skills will be obtained by a certificate in one of the core skills from an accredited Trade School, General Contractor's License, Journeyman license, 1500 hours OJT with a Maintenance Specialist A or from a certificate program sponsored by the UBC.",
